Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 18:34:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Dashboard: roof view with every panel and its live power

Card 'Dachy' on the dashboard (menu item Dachy): one roof per inverter with
exactly the panels from the readings - Hoymiles panels from the MPPT panel
settings (estimated share of the string), SolarEdge panels from the cloud
optimizer list grouped by string. Colour = share of rated power, tap a panel
for voltage, current, today's energy and temperature.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EySGZ7zzCqzbQeGccwYzek
